{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610210/extras/446917af4d2463afb018ee5dd858e88d.avif?t=1772199086\" width=360 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE LAWLESS ERA OF THE ENDLESS UNIVERSE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>&quot;WANT TO FEEL TRULY RETRO?&quot;</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610210/extras/fc8c338410b9cfc06f573800164d0b84.avif?t=1772199086\" width=1560 height=1188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KLOSTYN</strong> is a sci-fi <strong>retro FPS</strong> that faithfully recreates the late-'90s shooter experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game follows Ethan Nova, an archaeologist from the Genesis team on a mission to explore the distant planet Arcadia, where a photosynthetic alien species has been discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Arcadia has already been taken over by space pirates, and the Genesis team's ship is shot down in a surprise attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ethan survives the crash\u2014and his fight for survival is just beginning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic late-'90s low-poly models &amp; pixelated textures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 weapons</strong> + <strong>3 hidden weapons</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ main campaign maps</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15+ enemy types</strong> (space pirates, robots, alien creatures)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 boss levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 difficulty modes</strong>: Easy, Normal, Hard, Impossible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Body horror-inspired enemy designs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilotable vehicles</strong>: Mecha suit and hover bike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom map support(.tscn)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal gore effects</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic cinematic-style</strong> intro, ending, and cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons with <strong>Alt-Fire</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3610210?t=1772199086","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610210/29f2d82578c3d424517a7ada43b11b7f78663db9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772199086","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610210/49250b595d0814105ac4a3d7f14dffc6bd81696d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772199086","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610210/49250b595d0814105ac4a3d7f14dffc6bd81696d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772199086","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains blood, dismemberment, and body explosions, as well as some horror elements. Viewer discretion is advised."},"demos":[{"appid":3648570,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3610210/extras/446917af4d2463afb018ee5dd858e88d.avif?t=1772199086\" width=360 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE LAWLESS ERA OF THE ENDLESS UNIVERSE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>&quot;WANT TO FEEL TRULY RETRO?&quot;</i></stro